  "answer": "A clip outlasts leaving the page and coming back. Copied a Button at 1/2/3/8, then Exit Without Saving and back on the same page, the Button itself gone. Given back the same data, a paste with nothing selected adds a block at 1/2/3/8, phone 2/2/4/10, and with a block selected at 2/3/4/9, phone 4/2/6/10. The control before leaving added 2/3/4/9. With CAP-U11PAGE.json: it's the page that matters, the source block needn't exist. The clip was held in memory by the tool and given back as a stand-in for the real clipboard, so this says what a paste accepts, not what the real clipboard keeps. Inferred: a real clipboard keeps it.",
